ack_errors_are_not_judgments` shows a graph error raised in a callback surfacing as `Graph(\"missing\")`, with no record stored.\n   - `ending_without_a_corrected_submission_is_an_agent_error` shows an agent failure surfacing as `ValidationError::Agent`, with no record stored.\n   - `agent_errors_expose_the_agreed_string_payload` checks the error payload shape.\n\n4. **The returned future is `Send` and takes `&mut ValidationContext`.** `validation_and_answer_need_send_without_sync` wraps the `verify` future in `send(...)`, which checks that it is `Send`.\n\nThe tests cover both success and error paths, with assertions on each outcome. Every relevant test already carries a `{test}` reference to the subject, so I found no gap and no marking gap."
